WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
Jamie takes the manual drink while Ryu is stunned.

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:02.400
Jumping heavy punch begins the attack sequence at drink level 2.

3
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:02.850
Crouching heavy punch links to OD Palm.

4
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.050
OD Palm launches Ryu at the corner.

5
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:04.900
The first standing heavy connects during raw Rush.

6
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:05.550
A second standing-heavy input links before cancel Rush.

7
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.400
The cancel-Rush crouching heavy hits with the Drive gauge empty.

8
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.850
Heavy Bakkai links the juggle to Critical Art.

9
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:13.300
Jamie activates the low-health Critical Art version of Level 3.

10
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:18.000
The Critical Art cinematic continues.

11
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.400
Ryu lands after Critical Art; no post-Super juggle is performed.
